  "title": "Apply for public or subsidised housing",
  "intro": "Apply for a home under a housing programme. Your application is assessed against the programme's approved eligibility criteria and priority rules, and a home is allocated by an official with reasons.",
  "owner": "housing",
  "filled_by": "The applicant or someone helping them; an official at an office.",
  "authority": "Filed with the housing authority the nation names for its housing slot (shipped empty).",
